", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974685_1840524873122821_3055739933188055904_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=0aS5yYz9DNYQ7kNvwFXYj1n&_nc_oc=AdoDYd58Ymr0jgYY3MLAKLwlgmZyh0zmEanYH5BYqFLVHzILtxZBYVCNhAfrMlFMhKc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af5GCbQmvWF-zsYIizzE8HcUX4CfgwWqXS8Jbi7J5NfHpQ&oe=69FB4479"}, {"file_name": "5.png", "id": "3474397939524850", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974494_3474397942858183_7325370313459975246_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=eRu0fRoTPP0Q7kNvwGa6P3p&_nc_oc=AdqmbJcUaXGuiBRiTstCK_hFvf9FJgCpIUszRa4ToPcT0uj5n3vc3N0_KQ5-e_AO6-M&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af78DrKAlhKdF4YDKo1XOiyotnp5HTgI8zYv2BJeprJ9UQ&oe=69FB5B4B"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Hard Drive Logo (6).png", "id": "1060475455596738", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984476_1060475458930071_8663595066419356644_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=d7RjxiwzT7sQ7kNvwGJqoKv&_nc_oc=Adr7ZaJfd0IprXcD5qJ_SMYCGzD4nPod5Fhtj_Fg2vgVFAXuIcmWb6ds0FrONS-ypq8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af7c9d8_C1e8_8VVr8fi_P0G05MovrchEQ0XOPtsjMU1Zg&oe=69FB59CE"}, "display_name": "Hard Drive", "keywords": [], "long_description": "# *Hard Drive* \n\nHard Drive is a fast-paced, multiplayer, competitive electro combat driving game. Players control sleek, neon-lit motorcycle looking vehicles, known as bykes, which leave behind a temporary solid trail of light as they move. Players must outmaneuver their opponents by creating a trails of light that they cannot avoid crashing into, while avoiding the trails left by other players.\n\n# _Current Features_\n- Non PvP Driving Park\n- 6 Player Combat Arena\n- Season Pass with Progression Rewards\n- Cosmetic Shop \n\n## More Coming Soon. . .", "short_description": "Electro Combat Driving "}]}, "devel